// Per-machine secrets template. Copy to Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored)
// and fill in the values for release builds. Debug builds never read
// the DSN — CrashReporting.bootstrap is `#if !DEBUG`-gated.
//
//   cp Secrets.xcconfig.template Secrets.xcconfig
//   # then edit Secrets.xcconfig and set SENTRY_DSN below
//
// See docs/references/crash-reporting.md for the full pipeline.

// Sentry project DSN (the "data source name" URL). Empty is valid:
// when blank, the app boots without crash reporting and logs nothing.
SENTRY_DSN =
